[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00][(Slow rhythmic ventilator] beep... Beep... Beep...
[00:15.43][Deep Gregorian Chant humming in background:] Hmmmm... Mmmmmm...
[00:22.86]Ra... a... a... a... (Shattering voice)
[00:30.29][(Whispers panning around the head:] Mere yaar... mere yaar...
[00:37.72]Mere yaar...
[00:45.15]Dekh mere yaar, yun... sapne mein aana chhod de..
[00:52.58]Rahya nahi jaave, mane yun satana chhod de..
[01:00.01]He Ra a a a, mere yaar pyaare,
[01:07.44]He Ra a a a..., dildaar pyaare,
[01:14.87]Tere sang sootre laage,
[01:22.30]Laage ambar saje sitare,,
[01:29.73][(Background Choir:] Libera me... Libera me...
[01:37.16]Ambar kalgi tere dheer ki,
[01:44.59]Bas tu bharosa jodh de......
[01:52.01]Nahi toh ra jaan ke pyaare, yun satana chhod de,,
[01:59.44]Dekh mere yaar, sapne mein ana chhod de,,
[02:06.87]Jeen de tu maine, yun raatein thaana chhod de,,,
[02:14.30]Kade ya kahaani teri, mere sang bahi paave,
[02:21.73]Dhoonk ya bhitar ki, tan kha jaave,
[02:29.16]Kha jaave aatma ke, dheeramdheer ne,
[02:36.59]Maati ka kaal re bande... Maati ke ameer ne..
[02:44.02]Mere yaar pyaare pyaare... mane dhap jagana chhod de!
[02:51.45]Tohi jaaun tane main sabke hi beech mein,
[02:58.88]Titli ke pankha mein tu, khet mein tu, kanka mein tu...
[03:06.31]Jeth mahine mein deh sulgana chhod de..
[03:13.74]Mit jaunga main saara... meetana chhod de...
[03:21.17]Chhod de na mere yaar......
